{"text":"When I spoke to your parliament on my last visit, I laid out my vision for how our two nations can build that partnership. And today, I want to speak directly to you, the people of India, about what I believe we can achieve together and how we can do it. My commitment to a new chapter between our countries flows from the deep friendship between our people. And Michelle and I have felt it ourselves. I recognized India with the first state visit of my presidency, where we also danced to some pretty good bangra. For the first time, we brought Diwali to the White House. On our last celebration here, we celebrated the Festival of Lights in Mumbai. We danced with some children. Unfortunately, we were not able to schedule any dancing this visit.","words":[{"text":"When","start":0.52,"end":0.96},{"text":"I","start":0.96,"end":1.06},{"text":"spoke","start":1.06,"end":1.28},{"text":"to","start":1.28,"end":1.46},{"text":"your","start":1.46,"end":1.58},{"text":"parliament","start":1.58,"end":1.88},{"text":"on","start":1.88,"end":2.22},{"text":"my","start":2.22,"end":2.36},{"text":"last","start":2.36,"end":2.58},{"text":"visit","start":2.58,"end":2.94,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":3.72,"end":3.86},{"text":"laid","start":3.86,"end":4.02},{"text":"out","start":4.02,"end":4.22},{"text":"my","start":4.22,"end":4.48},{"text":"vision","start":4.48,"end":4.76},{"text":"for","start":4.76,"end":5.0},{"text":"how","start":5.0,"end":5.26},{"text":"our","start":5.26,"end":5.8},{"text":"two","start":5.8,"end":5.98},{"text":"nations","start":5.98,"end":6.32},{"text":"can","start":6.32,"end":6.68},{"text":"build","start":6.68,"end":6.96},{"text":"that","start":6.96,"end":7.22},{"text":"partnership","start":7.22,"end":7.68,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":8.62,"end":8.74},{"text":"today","start":8.74,"end":8.92,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":8.94,"end":9.02},{"text":"want","start":9.02,"end":9.12},{"text":"to","start":9.12,"end":9.18},{"text":"speak","start":9.18,"end":9.42},{"t